{
  "title": "Internet Gateway · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "VPC와 인터넷 사이에 직접 통신할 경로를 제공합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Internet Gateway</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#guide-1\">인터넷 연결에 필요한 구성</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#guide-2\">직접 공개할 대상 구분하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>29 / 62</span></div><h1>Internet Gateway</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>인터넷 게이트웨이(IGW)는 <strong>VPC와 인터넷 사이의 통신을 연결하는 구성 요소</strong>입니다. VPC에 연결하고, 서브넷의 라우팅 테이블에서 인터넷행 트래픽의 대상으로 지정합니다.</p><p>인터넷에 공개할 서버나 로드 밸런서를 구성할 때 사용합니다. 게이트웨이 연결 외에도 주소 설정과 보안 규칙이 맞아야 실제 인터넷 통신이 가능합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"vpc-attachment\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"ipv4-public-address\"></span><h2>인터넷 연결에 필요한 구성</h2><p>VPC에 인터넷 게이트웨이를 연결하고 공개 서브넷의 라우팅 테이블에 인터넷으로 향하는 경로를 추가합니다. IPv4의 일반적인 기본 경로는 <code>0.0.0.0/0</code>입니다.</p><p>EC2가 IPv4 인터넷과 직접 통신하려면 퍼블릭 IPv4 주소 또는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a>가 필요합니다. 보안 그룹과 NACL에서도 필요한 포트를 허용합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"ipv6-routing\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"egress-only-internet-gateway\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"internet-access-troubleshooting\"></span><h2>직접 공개할 대상 구분하기</h2><p>웹 서비스를 제공할 때는 로드 밸런서만 인터넷에 공개하고 애플리케이션 서버는 비공개로 둘 수 있습니다. 서버가 업데이트를 내려받는 등 외부로만 연결해야 한다면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a>를 검토합니다.</p><p>IPv6에서 내부가 시작한 연결의 응답만 받으려면 Egress-only Internet Gateway<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>를 사용합니다. IPv4 NAT와는 주소 및 동작 방식이 다릅니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>IPv4 인터넷 연결 확인 순서</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>인터넷 게이트웨이</strong><span>VPC에 연결</span></li><li><strong>공개 서브넷 경로</strong><span>기본 경로 지정</span></li><li><strong>주소·보안 설정</strong><span>퍼블릭 IP와 포트 허용</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">인터넷 게이트웨이 하나만 추가해 모든 서버가 자동으로 공개되는 것은 아닙니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>공개 서브넷의 웹 서버에 퍼블릭 IP를 부여하고 HTTPS 포트만 허용합니다. 데이터베이스는 인터넷 게이트웨이로 직접 향하지 않는 비공개 서브넷에 둡니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>Egress-only Internet Gateway</strong> — IPv6 리소스가 외부로 시작한 통신과 그 응답을 허용하는 VPC 구성 요소입니다. 외부에서 먼저 시작하는 연결을 막습니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/userguide/VPC_Internet_Gateway.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Enable internet access for a VPC using an internet gateway ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q009/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q009\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q009\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q009</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q009/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a public subnet must receive requests directly from internet clients. Which combination is required?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only an S3 gateway endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a route to a NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A route to an internet gateway, a public address, and permissive security rules</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a private IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>로 향하는 경로와 외부에서 도달할 주소, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a>/<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">NACL</a> 허용이 함께 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q010\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q010\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q010</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q010/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a private subnet needs outbound IPv4 access to an internet package repository. What is a typical design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q010\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A NAT gateway in a public subnet and a route from the private subnet to it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q010\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Attach an internet gateway directly to the private subnet</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q010\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Deploy only CloudFront</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q010\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Use a Route 53 failover policy</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · 퍼블릭 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>를 통해 외부 연결을 시작하고 응답받는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q017\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q017\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q017</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q017/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A private EC2 instance needs access to S3 without routing S3 traffic through a NAT gateway. What is usually the simplest choice?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A public Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">VPC peering</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">라우트 테이블</a>을 통해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>로 사설 경로를 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,3\" data-question=\"Q083\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q083\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q083</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q083/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a private subnet needs to access only S3. Which TWO components reduce NAT usage and internet exposure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Configure the subnet's route table</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Assign an Elastic IP address to the EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Require a default route to an internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Create an S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Allow inbound access from 0.0.0.0/0</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, D</strong> · 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>와 적절한 라우트 연결을 사용한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 접근에 공인 주소나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>가 필수는 아니다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q011\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q011\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q011</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q011/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application runs in two Availability Zones and uses zonal public NAT gateways. If one AZ fails, workloads in the surviving AZ must retain outbound internet access. Which NAT design should the architect use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q011\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Add only a network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q011\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Use a single NAT gateway in AZ A</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q011\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Deploy a NAT gateway in each AZ and route each subnet to its local NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q011\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Attach one Elastic IP to both AZs simultaneously</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>와 경로는 단일 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a> 의존을 제거하고 교차 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 트래픽도 줄인다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">이전 용어 <b>IAM</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/\">다음 용어 <b>Kinesis Data Streams</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
